	(text "Power: 6-7 V from the off-board LM2596 buck enters at J1 and feeds the ESP32 DevKit VIN;\nthe DevKit's own regulator supplies +3V3 to the MAX31856 and the front panel.\n24 V does not enter this board: the PSU feeds the DM542T directly, and the 24 V supply and\nheater connect to the MOSFET module's own screw terminals (VIN+/VIN-, OUT+/OUT-).\nU3: the module's J1 row (TRIG/PWM x2, GND x2) plugs into a 1x4 female socket.\nU1/U2/U3 are plug-in modules: their footprints are female sockets.\nDM542T: J2 = PUL+, PUL-, DIR+, DIR-, ENA+, ENA- (driver order); each minus pin is GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "21506fff-bbbd-4a81-acb7-7e3d3be3ea08")
	)
